sequenceDiagram
  participant M as Model / provider
  participant P as Your parser
  participant G as guardEvents()
  participant X as executeTool()

  M->>P: tool_call start (name known)
  P->>G: GuardEvent tool_call start
  Note over G: allowTools / denyTools may block

  M->>P: tool_call delta (argsText chunks)
  P->>G: GuardEvent tool_call delta
  Note over G: maxToolArgsBytes counts bytes

  M->>P: tool_call done (full args JSON)
  P->>G: GuardEvent tool_call done
  Note over G: blockToolArgs matches args

  alt policy violation block/warn
    G-->>P: finish policy_violation
    G-->>P: onViolation logged
  else audit mode violation
    G->>P: pass tool_call done
    G-->>P: onViolation logged
    P->>X: execute (app decides)
  else clean
    G->>P: pass tool_call done
    P->>X: executeTool()
  end
